TI  - From WebGIS to a Digital Twin for Sustainable Water Governance and Climate-Resilient River Basin District Planning: The AUBAC Case in Central Italy
PY  - 2026
T2  - Sustainability (Switzerland)
VL  - 18
IS  - 5
