TI  - Investigating the Applicability of Industry 4.0 Technologies in Road Construction Projects: A Quantitative Research Design From Construction 4.0 Perspectives
PY  - 2025
T2  - Engineering Reports
VL  - 7
IS  - 10
C7  - e70406
