TI  - Nunchi as safety labor: a phenomenological study of transgender women’s survival in South Korea
PY  - 2026
T2  - International Journal of Transgender Health
DO  - 10.1080/26895269.2026.2669181
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/105038141564?origin=resultslist
