TI  - Integrating Advanced Technologies for Environmental Valuation in Legacy Mining Sites: The Role of Digital Twins at Lavrion Technological and Cultural Park
PY  - 2025
T2  - Sensors
VL  - 25
IS  - 19
C7  - 5941
