TI  - Dynamic Digital Twin Network for Real-Time Safety Monitoring and Predictive Risk Assessment of Hydrogen Refueling Infrastructure
PY  - 2026
T2  - Energy Engineering: Journal of the Association of Energy Engineering
VL  - 123
IS  - 8
C7  - 3
