TI  - From Digital Motion Capture to Human-Friendly Forestry Machines: A Digital Human Modeling Framework—Case Study in Design and Prototyping of Forestry Machines
PY  - 2026
T2  - Forests
VL  - 17
IS  - 2
C7  - 235
