TI  - Carbon Dioxide Transport Pipeline Systems: Overview of Technical Characteristics, Safety, Integrity and Cost, and Potential Application of Digital Twin
PY  - 2022
T2  - Journal of Energy Resources Technology, Transactions of the ASME
VL  - 144
IS  - 9
