TI  - A Systematic Survey of Digital Twin Applications: Transferring Knowledge From Automotive and Aviation to Maritime Industry
PY  - 2025
T2  - IEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems
VL  - 26
IS  - 4
SP  - 4240
EP  - 4259
DO  - 10.1109/TITS.2025.3535593
