TI  - Organising digital twin in the built environment: a systematic review and research directions on the missing links of use and user perspectives of digital twin in Architecture, Engineering and Construction (AEC) sector
PY  - 2025
T2  - Construction Management and Economics
VL  - 43
IS  - 6
SP  - 465
